  "scope": [
    "Pinned mimalloc in compiler executables only through one shared module, registered in the native rootCLI with compiler feature and in compile_profile. Library consumers and emitted programs keep their allocator. No override/debug/secure allocator features or compiler algorithm/grammar/proof/admission changes. Lockfiles add only mimalloc0.1.39/libmimalloc-sys0.1.35, with some root package-block ordering changes and no upgrades.",
    "Standard retainedAE/source972 control and currentDeflate/runtime. Eight primary source-to-Object and any separately recorded complete-executable observations use serial ABBA/BAAB order;61programflags+2workers common. Fixed adapter cached. Construction,checks,screens,fixtures and archival excluded; no heavy competing job overlaps primary timing. Alladverseobservations remain.",
    "Every source,bytecode,Object,complete metadata byte and cached complete executable matches. Fourteen fixturepairs match. No new emitted-program runtime performance campaign is claimed. Root defaultCLI check fails with the same two preexisting E0433feature-gating errors on original baseline and allocator candidate; real nativeCLI with explicit cranelift_build check passes. The first missing-source-checksum setup failure and default0 timing-counter sandbox denial are preserved; unchanged default0 retry passes allfiles/full-executable gates.",
    "Compiler executables/dependency libraries are excluded and hash-pinned. Pure replay checks saved sources/data and recomputes means/blocks without new compilation or timing. Complete compilation below ten seconds remains open until separately verified."
  ],
